# Jace, Vryn's Prodigy: "If there are five or more cards in your graveyard, exile Jace, then return him ... transformed."
# Cast on turn 1 (two Moxen pay), Jace loots on turn 3 with an empty graveyard: he draws, discards the Island Bot1 names,
# and with one card in the graveyard he stays Jace, tapped, with no loyalty counters. The control, where the fifth card flips
# him, is jace-vryns-prodigy-flips-with-five-cards-in-the-graveyard-and-casts-a-bolt-again.

